  "id": "cboettig/gbif",
  "title": "H3-Indexed cloud-optimized snapshots of GBIF ",
  "description": "Cloud-optimized GeoParquet snapshots of Global Biodiversity Information Facility (GBIF) occurrence records covering over 3 billion biodiversity observations worldwide. Records are enriched with H3 hierarchical hexagonal spatial index keys at resolutions 0\u201310 and partitioned by H3 resolution-0 cell for fast spatial aggregations. Includes derived products: taxonomic aggregation counts per hexagon and a spatial join with historical US redlining (Mapping Inequality) polygons.",
